      {
        "title": "Statuses",
        "items": [
          "Draft: a cart held on the till. Paid: a finished sale. Cancelled: a held cart that was discarded.",
          "Refunded: every item of the sale was refunded. Each refund is also its own row, linked to the sale."
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "What you can do",
        "items": [
          "Open a sale to see its till, cashier, customer, items and payments.",
          "Reprint receipt from the row menu.",
          "Refunds are made on the till, in full or by item, so the drawer and the stock stay right.",
          "If the tax authority's answer for a sale got lost, the row menu offers Record CIS codes, to enter the codes shown in the tax authority's portal, or Send to the tax authority again."
        ]
      }
